      "id": "2124001866216509637",
      "text": "Kings still lead heading to the fourth in LA. It's 84-82 Sacramento. Hunter leads the way with 20 points. 18 for Acuff with 10 assists. 17 points and 14 rebounds for Sabonis. Murray has 13 points and LaVine has 11.",
