    {
      "id": "2123992011812622575",
      "text": "Kings lead the Lakers 62-54 heading to the half. Impressive. Sabonis leads with 15 points. Hunter has 13 points, 12 for Acuff and 11 for Murray. LaVine leads with a team-high +10 in the +/- category. Best team effort we've seen in a while.",
      "url": "https://x.com/James_HamNBA/status/2123992011812622575",
      "published": "2026-11-21T04:08:52+00:00",
      "likes": 21,
      "author": "James Ham",
