    },
    {
      "id": "2123984798184243280",
      "text": "Kings and Lakers tied at 28-28 after 1Q. Keegan Murray and Domantas Sabonis each have 8 points to pace the Kings. Tough first for Acuff with 4 points on 2-for-8 shooting to go with 3 turnovers.",
